    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63791" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογχ-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spearman</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				78
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογχῖτις, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>,
					ἡ</span>, plant <i>with
				spear-shaped seeds, Serapias Lingua</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Holly-fern, Aspidium lonchitis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> shrub
			yielding <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Ἰνδικὸν λύκιον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.100
			</span></i>.</div>
